  "Developer": "Kindling Games",
  "Genres": "Fighting; Platform; Sports",
  "Name": "Hieronymus Bash",
  "Overview": "Angels want control of all Heaven, Hell and everything in between. Devils want the same thing. How to settle this? Battle with weapons? Been there, done that, got the T-shirt. Then somebody had an idea: DODGEBALL!\n\nHieronymus Bash is a dodgeball game between angels and devils. Two players can play on the same team or on opposing teams. Up to four players can play. The game, somewhat, plays like dodgeball. The ball is thrown at an opposing player. If the player is hit, they are out. If they catch the ball, the other player is out and an outed player can return. Last team standing, wins. The game is not on a flat playing field but there are, instead, platforms above and below.",
